    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44627" root="&#xA;                        وصى&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَصِيَّةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>An injunction, a charge, bidding, order,</i>
or <i>command:</i> (K:) <i>an admonition, with an
endeavour to persuade:</i> and <i>a command:</i> its
place may be supplied by any word in which
is the meaning of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْرٌ</span>. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A will,</i>
or <i>testament.</i> (K, * TA.)

